@startuml
title Sequence diagram

actor User
participant "Engagement" as Engagement #purple
participant "Party Interaction" as PartyInteraction #red
participant "Product Configurator" as ProductConfigurator
participant "Product Order Capture" as ProductOrderCapture
participant "Product Catalog" as ProductCatalog
participant "Product Inventory" as ProductInventory
participant "Service Qualification" as ServiceQualification #blue
participant "Location" as Location

== QUOTE CONFIGURATION - COMPLETE CONFIGURATION AND ACCEPT ==

User -> Engagement : 70. Root Item characteristic values\n(List of Regions, #ofActors,..),\nChild Items Selected\n(SASE Edge Appliances,SW ,Actor Access Connecton,\nDNS Sec, FWaaS, ZTNA)\nChild Characteristic values\n(Chosen Locations, Characteristics values\nincluding number of Actors)

Engagement -> ProductOrderCapture : 71. **TMF701 Process Flow**\nPATCH /processFlow/3/taskFlow/3.3\n(characteristic("Root Item characteristic values, List of Selected Child Items and their characteristic values"))
activate ProductOrderCapture

ProductOrderCapture -> ProductConfigurator : 72. **TMF760 Product Configuration**\nPOST /queryProductConfiguration\n(.,contextEntity = quote id,requestProductConfigurationItem[productCharacteristic(\nnumber of Actors, place=[Country,Region],,.)])\n//Combined Request for all Quote Items//
activate ProductConfigurator

ProductConfigurator -> ProductConfigurator : 73. Compute Root Item Configuration for chosen number of Actors

loop for each selected Child offering

    alt for Actor Access Connection, SASE Edge Appliance

        opt for Off-Net entered locations

            ProductConfigurator -> Location : 74. **TMF673 Geographic Address** POST /geographicAddressValidation (submittedGeographicAddress)
            activate Location
            Location --> ProductConfigurator : 75. **TMF673 Geographic Address** 201 Created (validationResult=success)
            deactivate Location

        end

        ProductConfigurator -> ProductConfigurator : 76. Compute Product Configuration for chosen locations

    else for DNS, FWaaS, ZTNA

        ProductConfigurator -> ProductConfigurator : 77. Compute Product Configuration for chosen number of Actors

    end

end

ProductConfigurator --> ProductOrderCapture : 78. **TMF760 Product Configuration**\n200 OK\n(queryProductConfiguration.id, contextEntity = quote id,  State=Done\n[computedProductConfigurationItem(Fully Configured Quote Item)])\n//Combined Response for all Quote Items//
deactivate ProductConfigurator

note over ProductOrderCapture
  task 3
  **TMF 648 Quote**
  update Quote (Quote Items Configuration)
  completed
  task 4 "check Service Qualification (Subscriber Underlay Connectivity)", active
end note

ProductOrderCapture -> ServiceQualification : 79. **TMF645 Service Qulification**\nPOST checkServiceQualification\n(serviceQualificationItem\n[service="Subscriber Underlay Connectivity", place,\nserviceCharacteristic="ON-NET"])
activate ServiceQualification

note over ServiceQualification : perform checkServiceQualification procedure\nfor all ON-NET locations

ServiceQualification --> ProductOrderCapture : 80. **TMF645 Service Qulification**\n201 Created (serviceQualificationItem\n[service="Subscriber Underlay Connectivity", place,\nqualificationResult=qualified])
deactivate ServiceQualification

note over ProductOrderCapture
  task 4
  **TMF 648 Quote**
  update Quote (Quote Items Configuration)
  completed
  task 5 "Finalize Quote, Get Quote Acceptance", active
end note

opt total quote, final price re-calculation

    ProductOrderCapture -> ProductConfigurator : 81. **TMF760 Product Configuration**\nPOST /queryProductConfiguration\n(contextEntity = quote id,  State=Done\n[requestProductConfigurationItem(Fully Configured Quote Item)])\n//Combined Response for all Quote Items//
    activate ProductConfigurator

    ProductConfigurator -> ProductConfigurator : 82. Re-calculate final price (e.g. apply discount)

    ProductConfigurator --> ProductOrderCapture : 83. **TMF760 Product Configuration**\n200 OK\n(queryProductConfiguration.id, contextEntity = quote id,  State=Done\n[computedProductConfigurationItem(Fully Configured Quote Item)])\n//Combined Response for all Quote Items//
    deactivate ProductConfigurator

end

ProductOrderCapture -> ProductConfigurator : 84. **TMF760 Product Configuration**\nPOST checkProductConfiguration (Fully Configured Quote)\n//Combined Request for all Quote Items//
activate ProductConfigurator

ProductConfigurator -> ProductConfigurator : 85. Check, Validate, Approve

ProductConfigurator --> ProductOrderCapture : 86. **TMF760 Product Configuration**\n200 OK\n([checkProductConfigurationItem(State=Approved)])
deactivate ProductConfigurator

note over ProductOrderCapture
  task 5
  **TMF648 Quote**
  update Quote (State=**Approved**)
  Get Acceptance
  hold
end note

ProductOrderCapture --> Engagement : 87. **TMF701 Process Flow**\n200 OK\n("Computed/Configured Quote Items, Allowed actions"\ncallback when information provided(processFlow.id=4,taskFlow.id=4.5\n//TaskTask Flow Information Required: Quote Accepted?))//
deactivate ProductOrderCapture

Engagement --> User : 88. Present Acceptance page for Quote

User -> Engagement : 89. Accept Quote

Engagement -> ProductOrderCapture : 90. **TMF701 Process Flow**\nPATCH /processFlow/3/taskFlow/3.4\n(characteristic("Quote Accepted"))
activate ProductOrderCapture

note over ProductOrderCapture
  task 5
  **TMF648 Quote**
  update Quote (State=**Accepted**)
  completed
end note

ProductOrderCapture -> PartyInteraction : 91. **TMF701 Process Flow**\nPATCH /processFlow/1/taskFlow/1.4\n(characteristic("Configured and Accepted Quote"))
deactivate ProductOrderCapture
activate PartyInteraction

note over PartyInteraction
  task 5,
  **TMF683 Party Interaction**
  update interaction item
  completed
end note
deactivate PartyInteraction

@enduml
